    {
      "id": "9I9JcUAMHQB6NtKoB_h9V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 705.8584399213314,
      "y": -350.9703702811161,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 760341934,
      "version": 862,
      "versionNonce": 1345504242,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783178771698,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "不管什么策略，\n要一直在投资市场里面玩， \n可能是终生，\n所以一个赌博式的策略必死，\n概率学上必死，多次后成功率接近0%\n必须找到一个可能终身或长期使用的策略\n因为钱赚到也会不停的再进入\n你的纸币必须转化为每一种资产的承载物（在你的一生中）\n风险和仓位管理",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "不管什么策略，\n要一直在投资市场里面玩， \n可能是终生，\n所以一个赌博式的策略必死，\n概率学上必死，多次后成功率接近0%\n必须找到一个可能终身或长期使用的策略\n因为钱赚到也会不停的再进入\n你的纸币必须转化为每一种资产的承载物（在你的一生中）\n风险和仓位管理",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-g81zVlH5IZEusfyG0Ucj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -139.49934242527024,
      "y": -127.48017905475746,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1657539374,
      "version": 251,
      "versionNonce": 1304293998,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783176651915,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "个人缺陷（大脑控制力）\n决定人能否只在合适自己的地方出手，而不要着急",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "个人缺陷（大脑控制力）\n决定人能否只在合适自己的地方出手，而不要着急",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
